# The build context is this directory, and it holds live state. The Dockerfile
# only COPYs requirements*.txt and app/, but the whole context is sent to the
# daemon (and cached in layers' build records) first. Keep state out of it.
data/
radio-public/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
Caddyfile
README.md
mock_bridge.py
